 231:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/ip4.c **** /**
 232:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/ip4.c ****  * Determine whether an IP address is in a reserved set of addresses
 233:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/ip4.c ****  * that may not be forwarded, or whether datagrams to that destination
 234:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/ip4.c ****  * may be forwarded.
 235:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/ip4.c ****  * @param p the packet to forward
 236:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/ip4.c ****  * @return 1: can forward 0: discard
